<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NAM" style="id">RRK34.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">NAHUMU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Nabi Nahumu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nahumu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nah</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA NABI</para>
  <para style="mt1">NAHUMU</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NAM 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ebya Nineeve</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:1">Isa 13:1</ref>; <ref loc="JON 1:2">Yon 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 1:1">Hab 1:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebyahanwirwe ahari Nineeve. Ekitabo ky'okworekwa kwa Nahumu owa Elikooshi.<verse eid="NAM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 1:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:5">Kur 20:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA ni Ruhanga orwana eihato kandi ohoora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:2">MUKAMA naahora, kandi aine ekiniga kingi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:2">MUKAMA ahoora abazigu be,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:2">Kandi abarikumwanga aguma abainiire ekiniga.<verse eid="NAM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 34:6">Kur 34:6</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 34:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 97:2">Zab 97:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 147:5">147:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA tarahuka kuguubwa kubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:3">Aine obushoboorozi bwingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:3">Kandi taiha rubanja ha muntu ou rusingire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:3">Omuhanda gwe guba omu kasooroora n'eihunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:3">Kandi ebicu n'omucuucu gw'ebigyere bye.<verse eid="NAM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 1:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 33:9">Isa 33:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 50:2">50:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Akabukira enyanja, eyoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:4">Ayomya n'emigyera yoona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:4">Bashani na Karumeeli bihotoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:4">Ebirabyo bya Lebanooni bihonga.<verse eid="NAM 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 98:7">Zab 98:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:24">Yer 4:24</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 3:6">Hab 3:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enshozi zitetemera omu maisho ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:5">Ebibungo biyaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:5">N'ensi ehindurwa busha omu maisho ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:5">Ensi n'abagitwiremu boona.<verse eid="NAM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 79:6">Zab 79:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:20">Ezk 38:20</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:2">Mal 3:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'oha owaakubaasa kwemerera omu maisho ge aine ekiniga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:6">N'oha owaakwemera okubuguma kw'ekiniga kye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:6">Ekiniga kye kishukirwe nk'omuriro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:6">Kandi enkiri niwe azishatura.<verse eid="NAM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 1:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 46:1">Zab 46:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 100:5">100:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 25:4">Isa 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:14">Yoh 10:14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 10:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 8:3">1 Kor 8:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA ni murungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:7">N'ekigo kigumire aha izooba ry'enaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:7">Kandi amanya abamuhungiraho.<verse eid="NAM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:22">Isa 8:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:28">30:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka aryamariraho kimwe abazigu be</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:8">N'omwegyemure ogurikuhimintika n'amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:8">N'abarikumwanga ababingye, abahitsye omu mwirima.<verse eid="NAM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 1:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:7">Isa 10:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ni naama ki mbi, ei murikugirira MUKAMA?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:9">Aryamariraho kimwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:9">Abazigu be taribahoora bwa kabiri.<verse eid="NAM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 1:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:5">Yoel 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:4">Mik 7:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryayokibwa nk'amahwa gakwataine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:10">Kandi nk'ebitsintsi by'embuba ebyomire.<verse eid="NAM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 1:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 19:22">2 Bag 19:22</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 19:23">23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tihaine owaakurugiremu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:11">Akagirira MUKAMA enaama mbi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:11">Akaha abantu obwengye bw'okukora kubi?<verse eid="NAM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 1:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:33">Isa 10:33</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 10:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 37:36">37:36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:12">N'obu baraabe bari ab'amaani kandi baingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:12">Baryamarwaho, bahweho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:12">N'obu ndaabe naakubonaboneise,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:12">Tindikubonabonesa bundi.<verse eid="NAM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 1:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:27">Isa 10:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi na hati niinyija kuhenda omugamba gwe, ngukwiheho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:13">Ncwe n'ebikubohire.<verse eid="NAM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NAM 1:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 109:13">Zab 109:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:33">Isa 30:33</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:21-23">Ezk 32:21-23</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA aine eki agambire aha byawe, naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:14">Eiziina ryawe tiririguma nirihungurwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:14">Ndyacwekyereza ekishushani kyona ekibaizire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:14">N'ekiheesirwe ebiri omu nju ya baaruhanga baawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:14">Kandi ndyakurimira ekituuro, ahabw'okuba ori orikugaywa.<verse eid="NAM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NAM 1:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 52:7">Isa 52:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:17">Yoel 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:15">Rom 10:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba aha bibungo ebigyere by'ogwo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:15">Orikureeta amakuru g'ebigambo birungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:15">Akaranga eby'obusingye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:15">Iwe Yuda, guma oijukye amagyenyi gaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:15">Ohikiirize ebi waaraganiise noorahira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:15">Ahabw'okuba omubi tarigaruka kukurwanisa bundi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 1:15">Acwekyerereziibwe kimwe.<verse eid="NAM 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NAM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Okuhwerekyerezibwa kwa Nineeve</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:12">Yer 51:12</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:20">20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omusheenyaguzi aizire kukurwanisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:1">Ta abarinzi aha ngo z'amabaare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:1">Guma otaire amaisho aha muhanda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:1">Oyezirikye, oyegaruremu amaani gaawe goona.<verse eid="NAM 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 2:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1-7">Isa 5:1-7</ref>. </char>
    </note> (Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA naagaruraho ekitiinisa kya Yakobo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:2">Nke'ekitiinisa kya Israeli;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:2">ahakuba abanyagi bamazireho ebyabo byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:2">Baakonkobora amataagi g'emizaabibu yaabo.)<verse eid="NAM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 2:3" />Engabo z'amamanzi ge nizitukurikana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:3">Abaserukare be bajwaire ebijwaro bya karari;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:3">Ebigaari ebitengire orugamba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:3">Nibimurinkana nk'ekirimi ky'omuriro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:3">Embaraasi nizikangaza,<verse eid="NAM 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 2:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NAM 3:2">Nah 3:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebigaari by'orugamba nibirigitira omu mihanda rugyendwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:4">Nibimurinkana nk'emuri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:4">Kandi nibirabya nk'omurabyo.<verse eid="NAM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 2:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 46:12">Yer 46:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abakuru b'engabo nibeetwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:5">Bagyenda nibateera entsibo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:5">Nibeehuuta baza aha ngo z'amabaare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:5">Bataho eky'okwesangiza.<verse eid="NAM 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 2:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:31">Isa 14:31</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:1">45:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amarembo g'aha mugyera gaigwire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:6">Ekikaari kyona emitima ebahweire omunda.<verse eid="NAM 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 2:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 38:14">Isa 38:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Huzabu ajwekirwe busha, anyagirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:7">Abazaana be nibatonzya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:7">Nibacura, nibahuuma nk'enkombe, nibeemaamaata.<verse eid="NAM 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 2:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 46:5">Yer 46:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nineeve ni nk'enyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:8">Ei amaizi gaayo gagyenzire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:8">Nibeeta nibagira bati: Mwemerere! Mwemerere!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:8">Kwonka habura n'omwe owaareeba enyima.<verse eid="NAM 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 2:9" />Nimunyagye efeeza, munyagye n'ezaabu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:9">Ahakuba ebibiikire ti by'okuhwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:9">N'obu byakuba ebitungirwe eby'obuguzi bwingi.<verse eid="NAM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 2:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:7">Isa 13:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 21:3">21:3</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:6">Dan 5:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:6">Yoel 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:13-15">Zef 2:13-15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eshi yaayeshobera! Eshi yaasheenyuka, yaaba amatongo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:10">Emitima ebahweire omunda, amaju nigatetema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:10">Boona bahinduriize ahamaisho!<verse eid="NAM 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 2:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:15">Yer 2:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enyanga y'entare erahi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:11">N'ahu emigunju yaazo eriira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:11">Ahu entare ereetera ebyana byayo eki yaita,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:11">Hataine orikubikanga?<verse eid="NAM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 2:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NAM 3:1">Nah 3:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Entare etaanyaguriza ebyana byabo eby'okubihaazya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:12">Eniganigira enkazi zaayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:12">Eijuza amaaya gaayo ebi eitsire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 2:12">Enyanga zaayo n'enyama ezi etaanyagwire.<verse eid="NAM 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 2:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 19:9">2 Bag 19:9</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 19:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 46:9">Zab 46:9</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 13:8">Ezk 13:8</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 3:5">Nah 3:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA ow'amahe naagira ati: Reeba, naaba omuzigu waawe; ndyayotsya obutaaho bwawe n'omuriro, rurara emareho emigunju yaawe y'entare; eminyago yaawe ndyagimaraho omu nsi, n'eiraka ry'entumwa zaawe tiririgaruka kuhurirwa bundi.<verse eid="NAM 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NAM 3" />
  <para style="s1">Okucwekyerezibwa kwa Nineeve</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NAM 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 24:9">Ezk 24:9</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 2:12">Hab 2:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oru rurembo orurikusheesha eshagama ruryakareeba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:1">Rwona rwijwire ebishuba n'obunyagi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:1">Eminyago yaarwo terikubarwa.<verse eid="NAM 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NAM 3:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 5:22">Bar 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:5">Yoel 2:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okukwaya kwa kibooko, n'endigito y'enziga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:2">Emitsindo y'embaraasi n'okubomborekana kw'ebigaari!<verse eid="NAM 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NAM 3:3" />Abarikugyendera aha mbaraasi nibeeroha omu rugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:3">Zaarurara nizityankana, n'amacumu nigamurinkana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:3">Enyanja y'abantu eitsirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:3">Emitumbi etungamiraine etarikubaasa kubarwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:3">Abantu nibagiteeraho entsibo.<verse eid="NAM 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NAM 3:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 47:9">Isa 47:9</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 47:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:12">Kush 17:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:3">18:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebyo byona bireetsirwe obwamaraaya oburengyesereize;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:4">Obwamaraaya bw'ogwo orikurigirwa, kandi oine oburogo oburikwita,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:4">Orikureebya amahanga n'obwamaraaya bwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:4">Akarogyesa enganda oburogo bwe.<verse eid="NAM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NAM 3:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 13:22">Yer 13:22</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 2:16">Hab 2:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:5">Reeba naaba omuzigu waawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:5">Ndyahenuura ekipumpuriya kyawe, kikushwekye ahamaisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:5">Ndekye amahanga gareebe enjuuro yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:5">n'ensi z'obugabe nzoorekye enshoni zaawe.<verse eid="NAM 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NAM 3:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 2:9">Mal 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 4:9">1 Kor 4:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyakuteera ebihagaro, nkugayise,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:6">Nkugire eky'okushamaarirwa.<verse eid="NAM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NAM 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 15:5">Yer 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:9">51:9</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:13">Zef 2:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi abarikureeba boona baryakunuga, bakuhungye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:7">Bagire bati: Nineeve ebaire amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:7">N'oha oraagicurire?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:7">Mbwenu nyihe hi ab'okugiyaagira?<verse eid="NAM 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NAM 3:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 29:3">Ezk 29:3</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 6:2">Amo 6:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noogira ngu nookira Tebesi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:8">Eyaabaire eri ahagati y'emigyera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:8">Eyehinguririziibwe amaizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:8">Ekigo kyayo kiri enyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:8">N'amaizi gari orugo rwayo?<verse eid="NAM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NAM 3:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 12:3">2 Bus 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:43">Dan 11:43</ref>. </char>
    </note> Esiopia na Misri zikaba ziri amaani gaayo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:9">Agataine bugarukiro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:9">Aba Puuti n'Abalibya bakaba bari abahwezi baayo.<verse eid="NAM 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NAM 3:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:16">Isa 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 20:4">20:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:3">Yoel 3:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu eraabe yaabaire eri etyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:10">Ekanyagwa, yaatwarwa omu bukwatwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:10">Abaana baayo abato baateerwa ahansi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:10">Baacwagurukira omuri buri nteeraniro y'enguuto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:10">Baateerera enteenyu abashaija baayo b'ekitiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:10">Kandi abantu baayo boona abakuru baababohesa enjegyere.<verse eid="NAM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NAM 3:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 75:8">Zab 75:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:17">Yer 25:17</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:27">27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naiwe oryasinda, oshoberwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:11">Osherure ah'okuhungira abazigu.<verse eid="NAM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NAM 3:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 6:13">Kush 6:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebigo byawe byona ni nk'emitiini eine ebijuma ebirikubanza kuhiisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:12">Ku etengyetsibwa, bigwa omu kanwa k'omuri.<verse eid="NAM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NAM 3:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 19:16">Isa 19:16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:30">Yer 51:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, abaserukare baawe abari omuriiwe n'abakazi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:13">Amarembo g'ensi yaawe gaiguriirwe abazigu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:13">Omuriro gwokize empimbi zaawe.<verse eid="NAM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NAM 3:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 22:11">Isa 22:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yetahire amaizi agarimara omu biro by'okugotwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:14">Ogumye ebigo byawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:14">Oze omu ibumba, okaate obudongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:14">Okwate eby'okubumbisa amatafaari.<verse eid="NAM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NAM 3:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 1:4">Yoel 1:4</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 1:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:3">2:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwo niyo omuriro gurikwokyeza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:15">Okaitwa rurara, ekakumaraho nk'enzigye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:15">Yekanyise nk'enzigye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:15">Oyekanyise nk'eseenene.<verse eid="NAM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NAM 3:16" />Okakanyisa abashuubuzi baawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:16">Baakira enyonyoozi z'omu iguru obwingi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:16">Enzigye ziimutsya amapapa, ziguruka, zigyenda.<verse eid="NAM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NAM 3:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:8">Isa 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:27">Yer 51:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abanyiginya baawe ni nk'eseenene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:17">Abahandiiki baawe ni nk'ekicu ky'enzigye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:17">Eziguma zibandami aha ngo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:17">Aha izooba ry'embeho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:17">Omushana gukijwa, zikaguruka, zikagyenda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:17">Hakabura owaamanya ei ziri.<verse eid="NAM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NAM 3:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1 Bag 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 76:5">Zab 76:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe mugabe wa Asiria 'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:18">Abariisa baawe bagwejegyeire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:18">N'abakungu baawe nibahungira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:18">Abantu baawe bataataaniire aha bibungo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:18">Babuzire ow'okubataaruura.<verse eid="NAM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NAM 3:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 37:18">Isa 37:18</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:15">Tonz 2:15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:15">Zef 2:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tihariho w'okutuubya obusaasi bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:19">Obuhuta bwawe ni bubi munonga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:19">Boona abarikuhurira ebyawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:19">Bateera omu ngaro nibakwesiimirana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NAM 3:19">Mbwenu n'oha otakahikwahoga obubi bwawe obutahwa?<verse eid="NAM 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NAM 3" />
</usx>